    {
      "type": "assign",
      "subject": "vKEsyHFk/9ncuT5DP#2ffhMTdn",
      "field": "description",
      "value": "Pending requests use canonical ownership evidence. Stop clears the queue and blocks new submissions until settlement."
    },
    {
      "type": "assign",
      "subject": "vKEsyHFk/9ncuT5DP#tlC2W839",
      "field": "responsibility",
      "value": "Delegate, steer, inspect, manage pending requests, and stop all work for the workhorse of a checkout it names, one at a time; each workhorse has its own"
    },
    {
      "type": "assign",
      "subject": "vKEsyHFk/9ncuT5DP#tlC2W839",
      "field": "description",
      "value": "Inspection reads actual turns, recent progress, descendants, and pending requests. Stop clears pending requests and interrupts the proven work tree. It observes settlement and reports complete, partial, or unconfirmed results. New work waits for resolution and a fresh user request. Existing ownership and epoch records govern effects."
    },
    {
      "type": "assign",
      "subject": "vKEsyHFk/9ncuT5DP#9V9fQDIT",
      "field": "label",
      "value": "a delegation's or a stop's outcome"
    },
    {
      "type": "assign",
      "subject": "vKEsyHFk/9ncuT5DP#kEF4DfR4",
      "field": "description",
      "value": "A workhorse works in its checkout, the directory that holds its vault, so it reads that repository's AGENTS.md, skills and Codex configuration. Its thread-link key is the tab session and the checkout together. It belongs to the checkout, not to the repository identity, so a new chosen checkout leaves it linked. noteActiveTurn keeps the turn running on a workhorse from turn/started on its current thread to the turn/completed of the thread the turn started on, which New conversation may have left meanwhile, and stopWorkhorses asks the operations of one checkout's workhorse, or of every workhorse of the tab, to stop its whole work tree. The coordinator's stop_workhorses tool stops every running workhorse of its tab session by voice."
    },
    {
      "type": "assign",
      "subject": "vKEsyHFk/9ncuT5DP#uK6QAuru",
      "field": "label",
      "value": "queue a delegation behind the running turn; clear on stop"
    },
